      "title": "TITANS REACH HIGHER",
      "description": "Careers | CSUF - Human Resources and Inclusive Excellence This page uses javascript to help render elements, if you have problems please enable javascript. Skip to main content Last Published 4/23/26 Hours Hours Go Here Lock Icon - login required Portal Login Resources Search Ask iTuffy Dark Mode icon Switch to dark mode Human Resources and Inclusive Excellence HRIE on this page Page Topics You are now inside the main content area Show / Hide Left Navigation Menu Close left col TITANS REACH HIGHER Your Titan Career Begins Here! right col left col right col left col right col left col Your browser does not support frames. right col left col right col left col Faculty Part-Time Faculty Full-Time Faculty Staff/Management Selet the Emergency Hire button to apply and be considered for positions needed for a short term. Emergency Hire Select the Staff and Management button to access our listing of opportunities for long-term positions. Staff and Management Students Leadership Positions right col left col right col background images and color left col Auxiliary Organization Jobs right col background images and color background images and color left col Auxiliary Services Corporation Associated Students Inc. right col background images and color left col Why CSUF? Cal State Fullerton is distinguished as the largest university within the CSU system with over 43,000 students. At Cal State Fullerton, our work is rooted in student success and community impact—but we know that supporting students starts with supporting our employees. CSUF is a mission-driven institution that values collaboration, service, and inclusive excellence, while also recognizing the importance of work-life balance. We provide resources, programs and flexible practices designed to support employee well-being and professional growth. Apply now and be part of the Titan Community. right col background images and color left col Employee Value Statement At Cal State Fullerton, we take immense pride in our campus, where every employee is driven by a shared purpose: to transform lives through the power of education. We are committed to fostering an exceptional employee experience where you will be a catalyst for change. right col background images and color left col right col background images and color background images and color background images and color left col right col background images and color background images and color background images and color left col Benefits at a Glance The Titan Community Work/Life Overview right col background images and color left col right col background images and color left col right col Back To Page Top mobile menu Menu Lock Icon - login required Portal Campus Wide Resources on this page Page Topics Search Icon Search switch to light mode Dark Mode"
