re‐track Assistant Professor position in Operations and Supply Chain Management with an appointment to begin Fall 2027. Assistant Professor, Entertainment and Hospitality Management Fullerton The Department of Management at California State University, Fullerton, invites applications for a tenure‐track Assistant Professor position in Entertainment and Hospitality Management with an appointment to begin Fall 2027. Assistant Professor in Speech-Language Pathology Fullerton The Department of Communication Sciences and Disorders at California State University, Fullerton, invites applications for a tenure‐track Assistant Professor position in speech-language pathology with an appointment to begin in Fall 2027. Assistant Professor in Cell or Molecular Biology Fullerton The Department of Biological Science at California State University, Fullerton, invites applications for a tenure‐track Assistant Professor position in Cell or Molecular Biology with an appointment to begin Fall 2027. Assistant Professor, African American Studies (with a focus on Black Cultural Studies) Fullerton The Department of African American Studies at California State University, Fullerton, invites applications for a tenure‐track Assistant Professor position in African American Studies with a focus on Black Cultural Studies with appointment to begin Fall 2027. Assistant Professor of English, Comparative Literature, and Linguistics, specialization in Asian American Literature. Fullerton The Department of English, Comparative Literature, and Linguistics at California State University, Fullerton, invites applications for a tenure‐track Assistant Professor position in Asian American Literature with an appointment to begin Fall, 2027. Assistant Professor of Mechanical Engineering Fullerton The Department of Mechanical Engineering at California State University, Fullerton, invites applications for two tenure‐track Assistant Professor positions in Mechanical Engineering with an appointment to begin Fall 2027. The department seeks candidates from all fields of mechanical engineering but is especially interested candidates with expertise in thermal-fluid sciences and manufacturing. Assistant Professor of Physical Geography Fullerton The Department of Geography & the Environment at California State University, Fullerton, invites applications for a tenure‐track Assistant Professor position in Physical Geography with an appointment to begin Fall 2027. Assistant Professor of Child and Adolescent Studies Fullerton The Department of Child and Adolescent Studies at California State University, Fullerton (CSUF) invites applications for a tenure-track position at the rank of Assistant Professor to begin Fall 2027. The area of developmental specialty is open, but preference will be given to scholars who will expand departmental expertise and contribute to the department’s mission to prepare undergraduate students broadly for careers working with children, adolescents, and/or families from diverse backgrounds. Of strong interest is a candidate with expertise in one of the following areas: child mental health and/or developmental disorders, development and learning in middle childhood, and/or best practices to support children in early childhood settings. Assistant Professor, Department of Criminal Justice (RACE & INEQUALITY) Fullerton The Division of Politics, Administration and Justice at California State University, Fullerton, invites applications for a tenure‐track Assistant Professor position in the Department of Criminal Justice (RACE & INEQUALITY) with an appointment to begin Fall 2027. Assistant Professor, Department of Criminal Justice (COURTS) Fullerton The Division of Politics, Administration and Justice at California State University, Fullerton, invites applications for a tenure‐track Assistant Professor position in the Department of Criminal Justice (COURTS) with an appointment to begin Fall 2027. Assistant Professor of Human Services Fullerton The Department of Human Services at California State University, Fullerton (CSUF) invites applications for a Mental health and/or Addiction studies tenure-track position at the rank of Assistant Professor to begin Fall 2027. Assistant Professor of Public Relations Fullerton The Department of Communications at California State University, Fullerton, invites applications for a tenure-track Assistant Professor position in public relations, with an appointment beginning in August 2027. This is your opportunity to bring your passion and expertise to a dynamic, future-oriented faculty where you will directly impact nearly 1,500 diverse students across our premier mass communications programs. Situated in the second-largest media market in the United States, CSUF offers an unparalleled ecosystem for collaboration and innovation—complete with state-of-the-art laboratory facilities, an elite internship center, award-winning student media, and our signature annual COMM Week. If you are eager to lead impactful scholarship, mentor driven storytellers, and thrive within a deeply supportive academic community, we welcome your application to join us in shaping the future of public relations. Assistant Professor in the areas of Motor Control, Motor Learning Fullerton The Department of Kinesiology at California State University, Fullerton invites applications for a tenure-track position at the rank of Assistant Professor in the areas of Motor Control, Motor Learning, or related disciplines with an appointment to begin Fall 2027. Assistant Professor of Journalism Fullerton The Department of Communications at California State University, Fullerton, invites applications for a tenure-track Assistant Professor position in journalism, with an appointment beginning in August 2027. Assistant Professor in Experimental Physical Chemistry Fullerton The Department of Chemistry and Biochemistry at California State University, Fullerton, invites applications for a tenure‐track Assistant Professor position in Experimenta